      "header_utf8": "theorem centered_cross (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (h g : SL(2,ℤ)) (ψ φ : SmoothHeightSeed) :\n    inner ℂ (centeredSeed N h ψ) (centeredSeed N g φ) =\n      inner ℂ ((if frameIndex N g=frameIndex N h then waveVector ψ else 0)+\n        reflectedVector N (frameIndex N g) (frameIndex N h) ψ) (waveVector φ) "
